# Public repository

This project is **public** at [github.com/Bit-Byte5/RedRock](https://github.com/Bit-Byte5/RedRock). Treat every commit, push, and PR as world-readable.

Do not add private, personal, or device-local material to git. If it is already staged or committed, remove it before pushing.

## Never commit

- Google tokens, AAS, oauth cookies, passwords, emails used for sign-in
- `.env`, `.env.local`, `local.properties`
- `*.apk`, `*.obb`, `*.aab`, keystores, `*.pem`, `*.jks`
- Headset IPs, pairing codes, wireless-debug hosts
- `logs/`, captured logcat, crash dumps
- `mods/*.so` binaries staged on the Mac

Keep those gitignored. Tokens live in EncryptedSharedPreferences on the headset. Log `packageName` and `FetchState` only.

```
# ❌ BAD — private local config in the tree
QUEST_HOST=192.168.1.20
Token=oauth2_4/...

# ✅ GOOD — empty example only
QUEST_HOST=
```

Do not implement paid/DRM bypass or dump cracked APKs into the repo. Play fetch is ownership-only, personal use.
